  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the bank, stock prices plunge and regulators issue an emergency cap on real-estate lending—forcing the Section Chief to slam the brakes on every loan right when Muranishi calls asking for fifty million yen.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "はい、そうですか。分かりました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "総量規制の通達が正式に入った。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "これに背けば、この銀行は三日で潰れる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "今すぐ手持ちの不動産の融資を止めるぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "終わったな、日本。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "衛星放送の契約を募るための、スペシャルなアイデアを思いついたんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今月だけ追加で融資をお願いしようと思ってるんです。ほら、いい話でしょ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "すいません村西さん、とにかくまた来月に。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "おい、ちょっと待て！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "支払期限はいつだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "あと六日です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "六日か…",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "はい、そうですか。分かりました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, is that so? Understood.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "総量規制の通達が正式に入った。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'An official directive capping total loan volume has just come down.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "これに背けば、この銀行は三日で潰れる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If we defy this order, this bank will go under in three days.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "今すぐ手持ちの不動産の融資を止めるぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Halt financing on every real-estate deal on our books immediately!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "終わったな、日本。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It's all over for Japan.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "衛星放送の契約を募るための、スペシャルなアイデアを思いついたんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I just came up with a special idea to bring in a flood of satellite subscriptions.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今月だけ追加で融資をお願いしようと思ってるんです。ほら、いい話でしょ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So just for this month, I'd like to ask for an extra loan. Sounds great, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "すいません村西さん、とにかくまた来月に。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm sorry, Mr. Muranishi—let's talk again next month.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "おい、ちょっと待て！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, wait a second!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "支払期限はいつだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When is the payment deadline?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "あと六日です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Six days from now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "六日か…",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Six days...'",
